# Request: extend an in-flight navigation goal with new edges and nodes.
# nodes[0] is the stitch reference node (must match the last node already
# known by the handler).  nodes[1:] are the new target nodes.
# edges[i] leads to nodes[i+1], so len(edges) == len(nodes) - 1.
vda5050_msgs/Edge[] edges
vda5050_msgs/Node[] nodes
---
# Response
bool success
string message
